    r"\b(air ?strikes?|missile (?:strikes?|attacks?|barrages?|hits?)|(?:ballistic|cruise|hypersonic) missiles?|drone (?:strikes?|attacks?|swarms?)|shelling|shelled|bombard\w+|"
